b('3-mark: show that f : R → R, f(x) = (2x − 1)/3 is bijective and find f⁻¹.', 'f(x₁) = f(x₂) ⇒ x₁ = x₂ (one-one). For y take x = (3y + 1)/2 (onto). ' + N('f⁻¹(x) = (3x + 1)/2'))
